                <invention-title lang="de">BASISSCHICHT FÜR SCHUHWERK UND VERFAHREN ZU DEREN HERSTELLUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">COUCHE DE BASE POUR CHAUSSURE ET SON PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">STROBEL</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A strobel for an article of footwear includes a base layer and an upper layer formed of a polymer material covering a portion of the top surface of the base layer, leaving a portion of the top surface of the base layer exposed about an entire periphery of the base layer. The upper layer is directly bonded to the base layer without any fastening members. A method of forming the strobel is also disclosed.</p>
            </abstract>
